      `提取 ${activeExtCount} · 排除 ${activeExcCount} · ${activeSlotCount}/6 槽位`,
      ""
    );

    kpiGrid.append(kpiBooks.box, kpiEntries.box, kpiBudget.box, kpiRules.box);
